  "description": "Murata GRM series multilayer ceramic chip capacitor, size 1005M (0402), 1.0 x 0.5 x 0.5 mm, class II dielectric X7R (-55 to 125 °C, ±15 %) or X5R (-55 to 85 °C, ±15 %). Parametric: capacitance, tolerance (K ±10 %, M ±20 %), rated voltage (6.3 to 50 V) and dielectric are set per placement with the exact Murata part number; the default instance is 0.1 µF ±10 % 16 V X7R (GRM155R71C104KA88D).",
